API Endpoints
POST /accounts: Create a new account.
GET /accounts/{id}: Retrieve an account by its ID.
GET /accounts: Retrieve all accounts.
PUT /accounts/{id}: Update account details.
DELETE /accounts/{id}: Delete an account by its ID.
POST /accounts/{id}/deposit: Deposit an amount into the account.
POST /accounts/{id}/withdraw: Withdraw an amount from the account.




Payload Examples
Create an Account
{
    "acHolderName": "vijayakumar",
    "balance": 0
}

Deposit and Withdraw Money
{
    "amount": 200.00
}




